</div>\n\n  <h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4 leading-snug\">\n    <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3D1avop00062&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"hover:text-amber-400 transition\">\n      野性の王国 特別編 アフリカ原住民と生中出しをヤる AIKA\n    </a>\n  </h3>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 mb-6\">\n    <div class=\"md:col-span-5\">\n      <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3D1avop00062&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"block group overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-700/80 shadow-lg relative\">\n        <img src=\"https://pics.dmm.co.jp/digital/video/1avop00062/1avop00062pl.jpg\" alt=\"野性の王国 特別編 アフリカ原住民と生中出しをヤる AIKA\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/80 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition flex items-end p-4\">\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-amber-300 font-bold\">FANZAで公式サンプルを再生 ▶</span>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400\">\n        <span>メーカー: <strong class=\"text-slate-200\">DANDY</strong></span>\n        <span>キャスト: <a href=\"/actress/aika\" class=\"text-rose-400 hover:text-rose-300 underline font-bold transition\">AIKA</a></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1\">\n        <a href=\"/genre/AV%20OPEN%202014%20%E3%83%98%E3%83%93%E3%83%BC%E7%B4%9A\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">AV OPEN 2014 ヘビー級</a> <a href=\"/genre/tantai-sakuhin\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">単体作品</a> <a href=\"/genre/kikaku\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">企画</a> <a href=\"/genre/yagai-roshutsu\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">野外・露出</a> <a href=\"/genre/gyaru\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">ギャル</a> <a href=\"/genre/nakade-shi\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">中出し</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"md:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n      <div class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-4\">\n        \n<h4>【作品解説・見どころ】伝説のギャルクイーンAIKAが放つ、AV史に刻まれる野性味溢れる傑作</h4>\n<p>平成・令和を通じてギャル界の頂点を走り続けたAIKAのキャリアの中でも、最も野性的でアグレッシブなエロスを叩き出したAV OPENエントリーの記念碑的作品。褐色の素肌を惜しげもなく晒し、むせ返るような熱気の中で繰り広げられる本能剥き出しの交わりは、現代の整えられたAVにはない生々しい衝動に満ちています。</p>\n<h4>【実用ポイント】本能の赴くままに腰を打ち付ける圧倒的リアリズム</h4>\n<p>一切の台本を感じさせない、動物的な交尾そのものの迫力。AIKAの濡れた瞳と乱れ飛ぶ喘ぎ声が、鑑賞者の原始的な射精欲求を直接刺激します。規格外のエネルギーに圧倒されながら濃密な射精を迎えられる一本です。</p>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex flex-wrap gap-3 items-center justify-between\">\n        <a href=\"/posts/1avop00062\" class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-rose-400 underline transition\">\n          📄 作品の個別詳細ページを見る\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3D1avop00062&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-rose-600 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-rose-500 text-slate-950 font-black px-6 py-3 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-rose-500/20 transition transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-sm\">\n          <span>今すぐFANZAで本編・無料サンプルを見る</span>\n          <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"></path></svg>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-4 mb-6\">\n  <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 mb-2 block\">📸 高画質サンプルシーン</span>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-2\">\n    <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3D1avop00062&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"block overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-400 transition\"><img src=\"https://pics.dmm.co.jp/digital/video/1avop00062/1avop00062jp-1.jpg\" alt=\"サンプル画像\" class=\"w-full h-24 md:h-32 object-cover hover:scale-105 transition duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3D1avop00062&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"block overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-400 transition\"><img src=\"https://pics.dmm.co.jp/digital/video/1avop00062/1avop00062jp-2.jpg\" alt=\"サンプル画像\" class=\"w-full h-24 md:h-32 object-cover hover:scale-105 transition duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3D1avop00062&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"block overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-400 transition\"><img src=\"https://pics.dmm.co.jp/digital/video/1avop00062/1avop00062jp-3.jpg\" alt=\"サンプル画像\" class=\"w-full h-24 md:h-32 object-cover hover:scale-105 transition duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3D1avop00062&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"block overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-400 transition\"><img src=\"https://pics.dmm.co.jp/digital/video/1avop00062/1avop00062jp-4.jpg\" alt=\"サンプル画像\" class=\"w-full h-24 md:h-32 object-cover hover:scale-105 transition duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-10 bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-2xl relative\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-slate-800\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n      <span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-rose-500 text-slate-950 font-black text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-lg\">第4位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono tracking-wider\">品番: FJIN00062</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-xs text-amber-400 font-semibold bg-amber-950/60 border border-amber-800/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">\n      FANZA公式配信中（210~円〜）\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4 leading-snug\">\n    <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dfjin00062&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"hover:text-amber-400 transition\">\n      汚部屋住みの淫キャにも優しい日焼けギャルは… デカ尻で挑発してくるパート家政婦 蘭華\n    </a>\n  </h3>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 mb-6\">\n    <div class=\"md:col-span-5\">\n      <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dfjin00062&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"block group overflow-hidde